cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gpbiometricspy, please cite the software version used in your analysis. The published gpbiometrics R-package paper is listed as a related reference."
title: "gpbiometricspy: Python tools for Gazepoint biometric workflows"
type: software
abstract: >-
  gpbiometricspy is a Python port of gpbiometrics 2.0.0 providing Gazepoint-native
  workflows for EDA/GSR/SCR, PPG/HRV, pupil, gaze, fixation, AOI, TTL/event
  alignment, multimodal quality control, analysis, plotting, reporting, simulation,
  reproducibility, and interoperability.
authors:
